  "name": "Deadmines: an unselectable lockless lever refuses the opening spell",
  "contract": "Opening spells (SPELL_EFFECT_OPEN_LOCK) accept lockless doors (#6816) and buttons (#11923), but the click path GameObject::Use ignores a gameobject flagged GO_FLAG_NOT_SELECTABLE. The Deadmines Door Lever 101833 (type BUTTON, no lock; flags 48 at the client: GO_FLAG_NOT_SELECTABLE 16 plus GO_FLAG_NODESPAWN 32) is moved only by the instance. Expected: Opening 3366 cast at it fails with SPELL_FAILED_BAD_TARGETS (12) and the lever stays ready, so the spell cannot reach what a click cannot.",
